ggml_cuda_quantize_weights(type, src, dst, nrows, n_per_row, imatrix): GPU port of ggml_quantize_chunk for the
IQ/K quant types, byte-identical to the CPU path (tests/test-quantize-cuda.cpp), plus imatrix loader and
llama-quant wiring. The refine pipeline loads it from libggml-cuda.so via ctypes.

